  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of internal steering and control of Balkan Investigative Reporting Network in North Macedonia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision avseende intern styrning och kontroll, ISK, av Balkan Investigative Reporting Network i Nordmakedonien</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment aimed to assess the system for internal control as well as regranting practices and capacity of BIRN Macedonia. The consultant provided assessment report and identified the weaknesses in the organization as well as provided recommendations for follow-up. Based on the findings, Sida required BIRN to provide plan how will it  addresses the weaknesses as appropriate before and during the agreement phase.</narrative>
  </description>
